// Ch10 B02: Pell at the fen edge, before and after the Drowner. He walks the roots, never the water.
title: ch10_bark_pell_edge
location: ch10/ossa_fen
---
<<if $ch10_drowner_defeated>>
    Pell [neutral]: The roots are quiet. They will grow back over the cut. That is right. #line:ch10_bark_pedge_001
<<else>>
    Pell [worried]: Something drags in the roots. Walk where the bark is pale. It does not like the pale. #line:ch10_bark_pedge_002
<<endif>>
===
